| 社内側ゾーン(trust_zone) | `{{ trust_zone }}` |
| 外部側ゾーン(untrust_zone) | `{{ untrust_zone }}` |
| Forward Trust CA証明書名(forward_trust_ca_name) | `{{ forward_trust_ca_name }}` |
| Forward Trust CA証明書のCommon Name(forward_trust_ca_common_name) | `{{ forward_trust_ca_common_name }}` |
| Forward Untrust CA証明書名(forward_untrust_ca_name) | `{{ forward_untrust_ca_name }}` |
